# Version bump

When a change ships for a versioned product or script, bump its `VERSION` (path in `.cursor/project.md`) in the same commit.

Default PATCH. MINOR for user-visible features. MAJOR for breaking CLI/API.
Do not invent a version scheme; follow the file already used by that product.
